    IF `the application is for a warrant under section 529.1 or an authorization under section 529 or 529.4`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "An application for a warrant under section 529.1 or an authorization under section 529 or 529.4 may be submitted ... by a means of telecommunication" (another application is not covered)

